WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:15.139
"You're right," said Detective Smith.

2
00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:19.265
"The jewel thieves will try to steal the crown jewels next.

3
00:00:19.266 --> 00:00:23.234
We should . . . Rocket Girl?"

4
00:00:23.235 --> 00:00:26.883
A moment later Roxy was in the Metro City Museum.

5
00:00:26.884 --> 00:00:33.416
The whole building was quiet and empty.

6
00:00:33.417 --> 00:00:35.927
The crown jewels were in a large room.

7
00:00:35.928 --> 00:00:40.581
Hundreds of diamonds, emeralds, and rubies sparkled in glass cases.

8
00:00:40.582 --> 00:00:44.790
A large crown sat in a case in the center of the room.

9
00:00:44.791 --> 00:00:47.767
Diamonds covered the crown.

10
00:00:47.768 --> 00:00:52.318
"Hmm," thought Roxy. "Maybe I was wrong about . . ."

11
00:00:52.319 --> 00:00:54.503
Suddenly she heard a sound.

12
00:00:54.504 --> 00:00:59.352
Rumble! Rumble!

13
00:00:59.353 --> 00:01:05.541
"Motorcycles!" thought Roxy. "The jewel thieves are here!"

14
00:01:05.542 --> 00:01:08.344
Roxy hid behind a display case.

15
00:01:08.345 --> 00:01:11.303
A flash of electricity shot through the room.

16
00:01:11.304 --> 00:01:14.068
The lights went out.

17
00:01:14.069 --> 00:01:18.065
"It's a good thing I have my super vision," thought Roxy.

18
00:01:18.066 --> 00:01:21.458
"I can see in the dark."

19
00:01:21.459 --> 00:01:24.699
A group of small figures rushed into the room.

20
00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:27.792
They wore big boots and black vests.

21
00:01:27.793 --> 00:01:31.154
"The Electric Elves!" Roxy thought.

22
00:01:31.155 --> 00:01:36.364
"They're the worst motorcycle gang in Metro City!"

23
00:01:36.365 --> 00:01:38.985
"Quick!" said the elf leader.

24
00:01:38.986 --> 00:01:41.156
"Put the crown in here!"

25
00:01:41.157 --> 00:01:44.510
He handed a sack to another elf.

26
00:01:44.511 --> 00:01:47.450
Another elf smashed a glass case.

27
00:01:47.451 --> 00:01:50.701
He grabbed some rubies.

28
00:01:50.702 --> 00:01:53.380
"Pretty jewelry!" he said.

29
00:01:53.381 --> 00:01:58.256
"And it's all ours!" said another elf.

30
00:01:58.257 --> 00:02:01.487
"No, it's mine," said the leader.

31
00:02:01.488 --> 00:02:05.459
"And if you don't stop talking, I won't share it with you.

32
00:02:05.460 --> 00:02:07.827
Now get to work!"

33
00:02:07.828 --> 00:02:11.247
Roxy stepped out from behind the case.

34
00:02:11.248 --> 00:02:15.947
"Stop right there, you nasty elves!" she said.

35
00:02:15.948 --> 00:02:19.557
"Rocket Girl!" cried the elf leader.

36
00:02:19.558 --> 00:02:23.428
"Put back those jewels right now," said Roxy.

37
00:02:23.429 --> 00:02:28.519
"Nobody tells the Electric Elves what to do!" said the leader.

38
00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:30.615
He raised his hand.

39
00:02:30.616 --> 00:02:32.948
Sparks shot from it.

40
00:02:32.949 --> 00:02:38.755
Roxy smiled. "You think I'm scared? I'm Rocket—"

41
00:02:38.756 --> 00:02:43.359
Zap! A bolt of electricity shot from the elf's hand.

42
00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:46.983
"Aah!" Roxy felt a sudden shock.

43
00:02:46.984 --> 00:02:49.773
Electricity buzzed through her.

44
00:02:49.774 --> 00:02:53.075
She fell over.

45
00:02:53.076 --> 00:02:56.607
The elves laughed and grabbed the rest of the jewels.

46
00:02:56.608 --> 00:02:58.464
"Good shot, boss!"

47
00:02:58.465 --> 00:03:01.436
"Rocket Girl won't bother us anymore!"

48
00:03:01.437 --> 00:03:06.751
"Let's go back to our clubhouse!" said the elf leader.

49
00:03:06.752 --> 00:03:10.650
The elves ran out of the room as Roxy stood up.

50
00:03:10.651 --> 00:03:14.256
"I have to stop those elves!" thought Roxy.

51
00:03:14.257 --> 00:03:18.066
She leaped into the air but fell back to the floor.

52
00:03:18.067 --> 00:03:20.402
"Ouch!" said Roxy.

53
00:03:20.403 --> 00:03:22.316
She scratched her head.

54
00:03:22.317 --> 00:03:25.573
"Why can't I fly?"

55
00:03:25.574 --> 00:03:29.718
Roxy tried to fire her eye laser beams.

56
00:03:29.719 --> 00:03:32.140
Nothing happened.

57
00:03:32.141 --> 00:03:35.200
Next she tried to use her super breath.

58
00:03:35.201 --> 00:03:37.803
"Oh no!" Roxy cried.

59
00:03:37.804 --> 00:03:44.114
"I lost my super powers!"
